<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu 8-mth sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu 8-mth sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mining and metals group Outokumpu Oy gave the following breakdown of its January-August result (million markka):</p>
<p>    Net sales:		 Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95  Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Base Metals			3,157	  2,384	  3,869</p>
<p> Stainless Steel		  3,120	  3,777	  5,655</p>
<p> Copper Products		  5,069	  4,878	  7,291</p>
<p> Technology			   583	    626	  1,074</p>
<p> Other operations		   981	    993	  1,520</p>
<p> Intra-group sales	     -1,833	 -1,510	 -2,457</p>
<p> TOTAL			     11,077	 11,148	 16,952 @</p>
<p>    Operating profit:	Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95  Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Base Metals			 -304	   -152	   -442</p>
<p> Stainless Steel		    493	  1,252	  1,756</p>
<p> Copper Products		     93	    285	    388</p>
<p> Technology			    26	     19	     76</p>
<p> Other operations		    36	    -33	   -180</p>
<p> Intra-group items		  -13	    -14	     -9</p>
<p> TOTAL				  331	  1,357	  1,589</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
